"section-title\">\n                    <h3 mbr-text class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-section-title\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">Oszczędzaj na kosztach wielu specjalistów, mój proces to dopracowana metodyka pracy.</h3>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 mbr-section-btn\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href class=\"btn btn-warning\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">PRZEJDŹ</a></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
