          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article02 resumem5 d-none d-md-block\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\" checked>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Title Color\" value=\"#080808\" name=\"title\" condition=\"showTitle\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Tags\" name=\"showTags\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Tags Amount\" name=\"tags\" min=\"1&quot;\" max=\"3\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"showTags\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#898989\" name=\"tag\" condition=\"showTags\" selected>\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/dots.svg\" selected>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#efefef\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Pattern\" name=\"pattern\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Pattern\" name=\"pattern\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        \n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"title-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showTags\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        Main components ↗\n                    </h2>\n                    <div class=\"tags-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showTags\">\n                        <div class=\"tags-wrap\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                About\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"tags > 1\">\n                                Skill\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-tag mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-tag, .tags-wrapper\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"tags > 2\">\n                                Content\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-7\">\n                <div class=\"items-wrapper\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"item features-without-image item-mb active\">\n                        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>🟣&nbsp;</b>Szybkie ładowanie - bo nikt nie lubi czekać<b>&nbsp;</b></h4>\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Skracam czas wczytywania strony o połowę , optymalizując grafiki i kod css. Twoi odwiedzający docenią, że wszystko działa płynnie, a Ty unikniesz frustracji z ich strony i ewentualnej utraty klientów.<br><br>\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div><div class=\"item features-without-image item-mb\">\n                        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>🟣&nbsp;</b>Tworzenie&nbsp;wiadomości e-mail<b>&nbsp;</b></h4>\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Dostarczam kreacje e-maili marketingowych, które zachęcą Twoich odbiorców do dalszego kontaktu i zakup na stronie. Bo sama strona to jedno, a umiejętna komunikacja – drugie.<br><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item features-without-image item-mb\">\n                        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>🟣&nbsp;</b>Testy i usprawnienia twojego www<b>&nbsp;</b></h4>\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Jeśli tylko chcesz, wprowadzę testy A/B , które sprawdzą, co najlepiej działa. W końcu liczą się realne efekty, to jest najważniejsze, a nie tylko teoretyczne założenia.<br><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div><div class=\"item features-without-image item-mb\">\n                        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>🟣&nbsp;</b>Automatyzacja - czyli marketing, który kręci się sam<b>&nbsp;</b></h4>\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n                                    Dzięki sprytnej integracji z narzędziami do automatyzacji, wszystko dzieje się samo: od pozyskiwania adresów e-mail po wysyłkę spersonalizowanych komunikatów. Efekt ? więcej czasu na rozwijanie swojego biznesu, a Twoi odbiorcy dostają właściwą wiadomość w odpowiednim momencie.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
