            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content2\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Items\" name=\"rows\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"line\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\">\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">Dlaczego to takie ważne?</h5>\n                <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                    Subtitle</h6>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-9\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><br><br>Kiedy masz solidną podstawę – przemyślaną strukturę, responsywny design i spójną komunikację mailową – wiesz, że każda złotówka wydana na reklamy czy inne działania marketingowe nie pójdą w błoto. Bo co z tego, że ktoś wejdzie na Twoją stronę, jeśli nie znajdzie tam informacji, których szuka, albo przestraszy się <b>chaotycznego układu</b>.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-if=\"rows > 1\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"line\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\">\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Wood Construction</b></h5>\n                <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                    Subtitle</h6>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-9\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nullam nec\n                    lacus non leo luctus sollicitudin. Curabitur sit amet turpis eu sapien consectetur tincidunt. Duis\n                    laoreet sem eu massa sollicitudin convallis. Ut efficitur eu eros ut vestibulum. Nulla facilisi.\n                    Donec ut ultricies sem. Morbi vel urna quis dui euismod pharetra. </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-if=\"rows > 2\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"line\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\">\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Industrial Design</b></h5>\n                <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                    Subtitle</h6>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-9\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nullam nec\n                    lacus non leo luctus sollicitudin. Curabitur sit amet turpis eu sapien consectetur tincidunt. Duis\n                    laoreet sem eu massa sollicitudin convallis. Ut efficitur eu eros ut vestibulum. Nulla facilisi.\n                    Donec ut ultricies sem. Morbi vel urna quis dui euismod pharetra. </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-if=\"rows > 3\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"line\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3\">\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Web Development</b></h5>\n                <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-left mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                    Subtitle</h6>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-9\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nullam nec\n                    lacus non leo luctus sollicitudin. Curabitur sit amet turpis eu sapien consectetur tincidunt. Duis\n                    laoreet sem eu massa sollicitudin convallis. Ut efficitur eu eros ut vestibulum. Nulla facilisi.\n                    Donec ut ultricies sem. Morbi vel urna quis dui euismod pharetra.&nbsp;</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
