          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"powerm5 pricing1\" group=\"Pricing\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\">\n    <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n      <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n      <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n    </select>\n    <header>Card</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showList\" title=\"List\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\" checked>\n    <header>Color</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsHover\" title=\"Hover Card\" value=\"#20002e\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsHoverText\" title=\"Hover Text\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsBg\" title=\"BG\" value=\"#e0e1d3\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Icon Color\" value=\"#090f10\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n                    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-1920x1062.png\">\n\t\t\t</fieldset>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Pattern\" name=\"pattern\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Pattern\" name=\"pattern\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n      \n      \n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-head pb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n          <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"></h4>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-head pt-5\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-maintitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-maintitle\">&nbsp;PAKIET STANDARD\n<div>indywidualni klienci</div></h5>\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">RABAT 2026 12% <del>1 699 PLN</del><del><br></del></h5>\n            <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">1499 zł</h6>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Idealny pakiet, jeżeli chcesz świetnie wyglądać w sieci. Szybko i skutecznie bez zbędnych kosztów.<br></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn pt-2 item-footer \" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"index.html?zgloszenie-online\" class=\"btn btn-sm item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Obecnie<br>dostępny<br></a></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showList\">\n\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showList && showText\">\n            </div>\n              <p>ekskluzywna wizytówka</p>\n            <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Nowoczesny one-pager + prototyp</li>\n                <li>2 poprawki 1 główna strona</li>\n                <li>Pomoc w zakupie i pełna konfiguracja domeny oraz szybkiego hostingu</li>\n                <li>&nbsp;Strona zgodna z zasadami SEO&nbsp;</li>\n                <li>Automatyczna obsługa formularzy</li><li>Cookies integracja i konfiguracja</li><li>Konfiguracja i wdrożenie Google GA4</li><li>Certyfikat SSL - bezpieczna witryna&nbsp;</li><li>Responsywny design oparty o jakościowy szablon premium.</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb active\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-head pt-5\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-maintitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-maintitle\">PAKIET BUSINESS\n<div>&nbsp;małe i średnie firmy</div></h5>\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">RABAT 2026 18% <del>3 899 PLN</del></h5>\n            <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">3199 zł</h6>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Jeśli chcesz w pełni zaprezentować swoją ofertę i zacząć budować bazę przyszłych klientów.<br></p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn pt-2 item-footer \" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"index.html?zgloszenie-online\" class=\"btn btn-sm item-btn btn-warning\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Obecnie<br>dostępny<br></a></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showList\">\n\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showList && showText\">\n            </div>\n              <p>kompletna strona firmowa</p>\n            <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Nowoczesny multi-pager + prototyp</li>\n                <li>3 poprawki i 3 podstrony z main page</li>\n                <li><b>Wszystko z pakietu standard</b></li>\n                <li>Optymalizacja całej strony</li>\n                <li>Wdrożenie niestandardowego chatu i zapisu automatycznego kalendarz</li><li>Interaktywne pop-upy</li><li>Wdrożenie Testu A/B strony</li><li>Integracja z mediami społecznościowymi</li><li>Funkcjonalny zapis na newsletter</li><li><span style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; text-align: center;\">+2 Kreacje marketingowe</span><b style=\"font-size: 0.8rem; text-align: center;\"> 🎁</b></li></ul><ul>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}} item-mb\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"item-head pt-5\">\n            <h5 class=\"item-maintitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".item-maintitle\">&nbsp; &nbsp; PAKIET PREMIUM<br>wymagający inwestorzy</h5>\n            <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">RABAT 2026 10%&nbsp;<del>&nbsp;6 599 PLN&nbsp;</del></h5>\n            <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">5900zł</h6>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Chcesz maksymalnie rozbudowaną stronę<br> jako narzędzie, które aktywnie, pracuje.</p>\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn pt-2 item-footer \" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a href=\"index.html?zgloszenie-online\" class=\"btn btn-sm item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Obecnie<br>dostępny<br></a></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showList\">\n\n            <div class=\"mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showList && showText\">\n            </div>\n              <p>strona która zdobywa klientów</p>\n            <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Nowoczesny multi-pager + prototyp</li>\n                <li>5 poprawek i 5 podstron z main page</li>\n                <li>Pełne SEO lepsza widoczność w google</li>\n                <li>&nbsp;<b>Maksymalna moc pakietowa</b></li>\n                <li>Implementacja META pixel</li><li>Instalacja map ciepła</li><li>Integracja z Google Ads</li><li>Integracja z Google Search Console</li><li>Niestandardowe animacje strony</li><li>Wdrożenie płatności stripe, paypal</li></ul><ul>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      \n\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
