          "_name": "features4",
          "_sourceTheme": "showcasem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features4\" group=\"Features\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Number\" name=\"showNumber\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n                    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/dots.svg\" selected>\n\t\t\t</fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Pattern\" name=\"pattern\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Pattern\" name=\"pattern\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\n        \n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 bottom\">\n                <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-10\">\n                        <h3 class=\"title title-left mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".title-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Jesteś Coachem, Doradcą lub Psychologiem?</span></h3>\n                        <h3 class=\"subtitle subtitle-left mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".subtitle-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">Stworzę elegancką stronę, która wzbudzi zaufanie. Zintegruję ją z kalendarzem, aby klienci mogli sami rezerwować u Ciebie terminy.</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-2\">\n                        <h3 class=\"number-left mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".number-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showNumber\">01.</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"row top\">\n                    <div class=\"col-10\">\n                        <h3 class=\"title title-left mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".title-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Wprowadzasz na Rynek </span><br><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Produkt Cyfrowy?</span></h3>\n                        <h3 class=\"subtitle subtitle-left mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".subtitle-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">Oferuję Ci dynamiczny \"Landing Page Showcase\", który idealnie zaprezentuje jego funkcje i pozwoli na natychmiastowy zakup przez integrację płatności Stripe.</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-2\">\n                        <h3 class=\"number-left mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".number-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showNumber\">02.</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"row top\">\n                    <div class=\"col-10\">\n                        <h3 class=\"title title-left mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".title-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Prowadzisz Biznes Lokalny?</span></h3>\n                        <h3 class=\"subtitle subtitle-left mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".subtitle-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">Salon Kosmetyczny, Warsztat? Zaprojektuję unikalną wizytówkę, która zdeklasuje Twoją konkurencję. Zadbamy o SEO, by klienci z okolicy trafili prosto pod Twoje drzwi.</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-2\">\n                        <h3 class=\"number-left mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".number-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showNumber\">03.</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 image bottom\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/duzo%20projekt%C3%B3w-600x438.png\" alt=\"monitor_szablony_grafika\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\">\n                <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-2\">\n                        <h3 class=\"number-right mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".number-right\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showNumber\">04.</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-10\">\n                        <h3 class=\"title title-right mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".title-right\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Jesteś Organizatorem </span><br><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Konferencji lub Wydarzenia?</span></h3>\n                        <h3 class=\"subtitle subtitle-right mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".subtitle-right\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">Zbuduję stronę \"Event Page\", która sprzeda bilety. Zintegruję newsletter, byś mógł efektywnie komunikować się z uczestnikami.</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"row top\">\n                    <div class=\"col-2\">\n                        <h3 class=\"number-right mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".number-right\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showNumber\">05.</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-10\">\n                        <h3 class=\"title title-right mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".title-right\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Jesteś Twórcą lub Artystą np. Fotografem, Projektantem?</span></h3>\n                        <h3 class=\"subtitle subtitle-right mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".subtitle-right\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">Proponuję minimalistyczną, ale autorską galerię online. Stworzę przestrzeń, gdzie Twoje prace będą grały główną rolę, bez szablonowej nudy.</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"row top\">\n                    <div class=\"col-2\">\n                        <h3 class=\"number-right mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".number-right\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showNumber\">06.</h3>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-10\">\n                        <h3 class=\"title title-right mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".title-right\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Testujesz Pomysł?</span></h3>\n                        <h3 class=\"subtitle subtitle-right mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".subtitle-right\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">Mogę zaproponować Ci ultra-szybkie wdrożenie. Zobaczysz interaktywny prototyp w 48h, a gotową stronę testową w tydzień, byś mógł błyskawicznie zdobywać leady.</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
