          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"testimonials03 levelm4_testimonials03\" group=\"Testimonials\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        \n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Name\" name=\"showsubTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Status\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n                    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/dots.svg\" selected>\n\t\t\t</fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Pattern\" name=\"pattern\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Pattern\" name=\"pattern\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        \n    \n        \n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-18.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        \n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"mbr-black col-md-12 col-lg-10 align-center\">\n                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/kamil%20g%C4%85secki%20ceo%20portret-240x294.jpg\" alt=\"właściciel\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-text pb-4 mbr-black mbr-regular mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\"Odkryję twój unikalny wygląd witryny&nbsp; i dopasuję go do identyfikacji wizualnej marki.<b>\"</b><br>\n                </p>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showsubTitle\">Kamil Gąsecki</h4>\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-bold mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">DIGITAL INSPECTOR<br><br></h3>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
