          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features03 resumem5\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Icon\" name=\"showIcon\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color 1\" value=\"#00D372\" name=\"icon_1\" condition=\"showIcon\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color 2\" value=\"#ff5600\" name=\"icon_2\" condition=\"showIcon\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color 3\" value=\"#7179EF\" name=\"icon_3\" condition=\"showIcon\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#121212\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#f0f0f0\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                        WYKORZYSTUJE</h2>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row row-content\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 item features-without-image item-mb active\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <div class=\"icon-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-yt-gaming socicon\" style=\"color: rgb(243, 248, 6); fill: rgb(243, 248, 6);\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .icon-wrapper\">\n                            WEBSITE BUILDER</h4>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n                            Używam kreatora stron internetowych, który pozwala na tworzenie nowoczesnych projektów i pełne dostosowanie układów do potrzeb klienta.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 item features-without-image item-mb\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <div class=\"icon-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-code mobi-mbri\" style=\"color: rgb(243, 248, 6); fill: rgb(243, 248, 6);\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .icon-wrapper\">EDYTOR KODU</h4>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n                            Używam edytora, który pozwala na łatwe pisanie i edytowanie kodu HTML, CSS i JavaScript, zapewniając pełną kontrolę nad strukturą i wyglądem strony.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div><div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4 item features-without-image item-mb\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <div class=\"icon-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbri-bootstrap\" style=\"color: rgb(243, 248, 6); fill: rgb(243, 248, 6);\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .icon-wrapper\">\n                            BOOTSTRAP/LESS</h4>\n                        <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n                            Dzięki Bootstrapowi mogę skupić się na tworzeniu unikalnego i funkcjonalnego projektu, a nie tracić czasu na pisanie kodu od zera. To narzędzie znacznie ułatwia mi pracę i pozwala tworzyć wysokiej jakości strony internetowe w krótszym czasie.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
