-text, .carousel-item .mbr-section-btn\">Fusce\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdapibus,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttellus ac cursus commodo, tortor mauris condimentum nibh, ut fermentum massa justo sit\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tamet risus. Cum sociis natoque penatibus et magnis dis parturient montes, nascetur\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tridiculus mus.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showSlideButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-danger\" href=\"https://mobirise.co\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">SHOP\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNOW</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/3-1740x1059.png\" alt=\"photo3\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"carousel-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-10 col-12 offset-0 offset-md-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSlideSubTitle\" data-app-selector=\".carousel-item .mbr-section-subtitle, .carousel-item .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLorem\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tipsum\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSlideTitle\" data-app-selector=\".carousel-item .mbr-section-title, .carousel-item .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-regular mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSlideText\" data-app-selector=\".carousel-item .mbr-text, .carousel-item .mbr-section-btn\">Fusce\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdapibus,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttellus ac cursus commodo, tortor mauris condimentum nibh, ut fermentum massa justo sit\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tamet risus. Cum sociis natoque penatibus et magnis dis parturient montes, nascetur\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tridiculus mus.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"dis