          "_name": "features4",
          "_sourceTheme": "motionm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"features4\" group=\"Features\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background':bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Shape\" name=\"showShape\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"cardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Link\" name=\"cardButtons\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Border\" name=\"showBorder\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" name=\"borderColor\" value=\"#c7cb05\" condition=\"showBorder\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-1920x1078.jpg\" selected parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#eae8e4\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#20002e\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    \n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"main_header\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle || showTitle\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style ls-1\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">DOSTĘPNA</h4>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style ls-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">ŚCIEŻKA POZYSKANIA RUCHU</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Incidunt saepe voluptatibus animi, pariatur quo, at mollitia provident cupiditate voluptates quaerat, possimus quisquam praesentium magnam.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-list mbr-list-grow=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <div class=\"circle_animation\" mbr-if=\"showShape\">\n                            <div class=\"circle_fill circle\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"circle_null circle\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"content_box\">\n                            <div class=\"content_title\" mbr-if=\"cardTitle\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title ls-1 mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">AUDYT USTAWIEŃ KONTA GOOGLE ADS/META</h4>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"content_text\">\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .linkBtn\">Tutaj moje działania zmierzają do tego aby system reklamowy miał odpowiednie dane w odpowiedniej ilości, aby się uczył i pozyskiwał wartościowych klientów.</p>\n                                <p class=\"linkBtn mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".linkBtn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"cardButtons\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-primary\">Show More</a></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n           </div>\n            \n        \n           \n       <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <div class=\"circle_animation\" mbr-if=\"showShape\">\n                            <div class=\"circle_fill circle\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"circle_null circle\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"content_box\">\n                            <div class=\"content_title\" mbr-if=\"cardTitle\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title ls-1 mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">AUDYT SEO/UX UI</h4>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"content_text\">\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .linkBtn\">Dowiesz się, co poprawić, by zwiększyć ruch, poprawić pozycję w wynikach wyszukiwania oraz zapewnić lepsze doświadczenie użytkownikom, co bezpośrednio wpłynie na konwersje.</p>\n                                <p class=\"linkBtn mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".linkBtn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"cardButtons\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-primary\">Show More</a></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n           </div><div class=\"card col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <div class=\"circle_animation\" mbr-if=\"showShape\">\n                            <div class=\"circle_fill circle\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"circle_null circle\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"content_box\">\n                            <div class=\"content_title\" mbr-if=\"cardTitle\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title ls-1 mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">AUDYT E-MAIL MARKETING</h4>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"content_text\">\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .linkBtn\">Celem jest zrozumienie w jaki sposób twoje obecne praktyki e-mail marketingowe wpływają na osiągnięte wyniki i jak można je ulepszyć aby lepiej służyły zarówno firmie jak i odbiorcom.</p>\n                                <p class=\"linkBtn mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".linkBtn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"cardButtons\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-primary\">Show More</a></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n           </div></div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
