          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"features16\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Shw Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>    \n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Media on Left/Right\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        \n<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n                    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/dots.svg\" selected>\n\t\t\t</fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Pattern\" name=\"pattern\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Pattern\" name=\"pattern\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        \n        \n        \n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row main align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 image-element \">\n                <div class=\"img-wrap\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/audyt%20gads-1-814x635.png\" alt=\"audyt-google-ads\" title>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 text-element\">\n                <div class=\"text-content\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mbr-black align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\"><br>Sprawdzam, czy reklama pasuje do tego gdzie się wyświetla, komu się wyświetla i czy pasuje do tego na jaką stronę nas odsyła.<br><br></h4>\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-title pt-2 mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-title\">Zbadam jakie informacje dostaje system reklamowy</h2>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-text\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text pt-3 mbr-light mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text,.mbr-section-btn\">Tutaj chodzi o konwersje, ustawienia oraz komunikacje i reklamy. Dlatego dokładnie badam całą poprawność kampanii i wychwytuje kluczowe błędy dotyczące wykorzystania ustawień na koncie.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn pt-3 align-left\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-md btn-primary\" href=\"mini-pakiety-audytowe.html?formularz-audytowy\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">klucz to analiza&nbsp;</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>          \n</section>",
